{"shortDescription":"By Ateeq ShariffMost Gulf equity markets closed lower on Thursday as little progress in US-Iran diplomacy and persistent risks to Strait of Hormuz shipping unsettled investors.Concerns mounted after Mohsen Rezaei, secretary of Iran's Supreme National Security Council, warned in a state television i…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["By Ateeq Shariff"]},{"type":"p","children":["Most Gulf equity markets closed lower on Thursday as little progress in US-Iran diplomacy and persistent risks to Strait of Hormuz shipping unsettled investors."]},{"type":"p","children":["Concerns mounted after Mohsen Rezaei, secretary of Iran's Supreme National Security Council, warned in a state television interview on Wednesday that, should neighbouring countries cooperate with Washington to halt Iranian flights, Tehran would ensure their airports \"cannot function.\""]},{"type":"p","children":["Despite continued diplomatic engagement, divisions between Tehran and Washington over ending the conflict remain substantial."]},{"type":"p","children":["A senior Iranian official told Reuters on Wednesday that diplomacy must continue, even as Iran's president told the UN General Assembly that the country would not yield to US pressure."]},{"type":"p","children":["Geopolitical uncertainty continued to disrupt shipping through the Strait of Hormuz, where 10 commodity vessels transited on Wednesday, up from 7 a day earlier but well below the 10-day average of about 17."]},{"type":"p","children":["Saudi Arabia's benchmark index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:TASI","text":"TADAWUL:TASI"}}," dropped 0.8%, hit by a 2% slide in Al Rajhi Bank ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"TADAWUL:1120","text":"TADAWUL:1120"}},"."]},{"type":"p","children":["Dubai's main share index ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"DFM:DFMGI","text":"DFM:DFMGI"}}," was down 0.4%, with top lender Emirates NBD ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"DFM:EMIR